delegation.scope:
Search only existing files below apps, packages, scripts, docs, and .github, plus README.md,
package.json, turbo.json, and lefthook.yml. The snapshot intentionally excludes data, plans,
coverage, dist, node_modules, caches, temporary output, Git history, and secrets.

delegation.structured_output_contract:
End with exactly these sections: (1) Status; (2) Model and effort requested; (3) Aggregate table;
(4) Production/tooling file table; (5) Top 25 full-scope files; (6) Repeatability; (7) Workspace
mutation check; (8) Limitations. Do not include recommendations.
